> 128 Gb number  is correct for Digital Unix 4.0E. I would like to have some 
> smaller partitions for various purposes, and it seems that I am limited 
> to having only a-h i.e. 8 partitions max, so if indeed 128 is teh max 
> there is limited flexibility.

