servers are vulnerable to Denial of Service attack.

http://www.cert.org/tech_tips/snmp_faq.html

Compaq officially reports that the only impact on Tru64 systems is possible 
ungraceful termination of snmpd, in the event of such an attack.

http://ftp.support.compaq.com/patches/.new/html/SSRT0779.shtml

There are related patches in the latest patch releases that apparently help 
minimize or correct the security issues.

Anyone know of concerns or issues relating to this problem?  Any other 
thoughts?

