Answer:

yes - swapon is what is actually being used.  disklabel only show what was
written as a disklabel at one point in time but may not reflect current
usage.  To be sure it was suggested to check /etc/sysconfigtab, /etc/fstab,
/etc/rc.confg, and /sbin/swapdefault.

