Dear All,

There has recently been some discussion about a new vulnerability in the
OpenSSH package...see the forwarded message below. To summarise very
briefly:

(1) The OpenSSH maintainers recommend upgrading to 3.3p and enabling the
priv separation feature
(2) Unfortunately the priv separation feature does not work in all vendor
environments

Does anyone have any experience of this OpenSSH feature in a Tru64
environment, or any inside information on the vulnerability that would be
helpful to Tru64 managers? My systems are Tru64 4.0G with base-level
security, but I'll summarise comments received on other Tru64 systems.

