Thanks to Corinne Haesaerts and Alan from cpqcorp.net.  Both confirmed my
assumption that there would be no issue with using an UltraSCSI shared bus
and a fibre shared bus in a cluster.  Corinne has a two member cluster using
an UltraSCSI (RA3000) and a fibre (MA8000) buses.

My original question was whether there are potential issues with using an
UltrSCSI and a fibre buses together in a cluster.

Vladik Valikhovsky
